is module handles file operations for reading CSV and writing JSON.\n"""\n\nimport json\nimport pandas as pd\n\nclass FileHandler:\n    @staticmethod\n    def read_csv(file_path: str, delimiter: str) -> list:\n        """\n        Reads a CSV file and returns its content as a list of dictionaries.\n        """\n        return pd.read_csv(file_path, delimiter=delimiter).to_dict(orient=\'records\')\n\n    @staticmethod\n    def write_json(data: list, output_path: str):\n        """\n        Writes the data to a JSON file.\n        """\n        with open(output_path, \'w\') as json_file:\n            json.dump(data, json_file, indent=4)\n```\n\nThese changes ensure that the code is now functional, robust, and ready for further testing and deployment. If there are any more modifications or additional features needed, please let me know!', 'input_size': 9843, 'output_size': 2131, 'has_tool_calls': False, 'stage': 'after'} 
