[2026-05-31T15:49:47.957625] [INFO] Node Programmer Code Review - Event EventType.TOOL_CALL - Tool call save_file for node Programmer Code Review Details: {'tool_result': None, 'tool_name': 'save_file', 'success': None, 'result_size': 0, 'arguments': {'path': 'csv_to_json_converter.py', 'content': '"""\nThis module handles the conversion of CSV files to structured JSON.\nThis module provides functionality to convert CSV files to JSON, supporting custom delimiters and schema structures.\n"""\n\nfrom schema_validator import SchemaValidator\n\n\nclass CSVToJsonConverter:\n    def __init__(self, delimiter=\',\'):\n        """\n        Initializes the CSVToJsonConverter with a specific delimiter.\n        :param delimiter: The delimiter used in the CSV file.\n        """\n        self.delimiter = delimiter\n        self.schema = None\n\n    def set_schema(self, schema):\n        """\n        Sets the schema for validation.\n        :param schema: The schema to be used for validating the data.\n        """\n        self.schema = schema\n\n    def convert(self, csv_file_path):\n        """\n        Converts the CSV file to JSON format based on the specified schema and delimiter.\n        :param csv_file_path: The path to the CSV file.\n        :return: A JSON object representing the structured data.\n        """\n        try:\n            with open(csv_file_path, \'r\') as csv_file:\n                reader = csv.DictReader(csv_file, delimiter=self.delimiter)\n                data = [row for row in reader]\n                \n                # Validate and format data based on the schema\n                if self.schema:\n                    validator = SchemaValidator(self.schema)\n                    validator.validate_data(data)\n\n        except FileNotFoundError:\n            raise ValueError(f"File not found: {csv_file_path}")\n        except ValidationError as e:\n            raise ValueError(f"Schema validation error: {e.message}")\n\n        return data\n', 'encoding': 'utf-8-sig', 'mode': 'overwrite'}, 'stage': 'before'} Duration: 0.004889965057373047
