/activate\n       ```\n\n2. **Install Dependencies**:\n   - Install the required packages using pip:\n     ```bash\n     pip install pandas jsonschema\n     ```\n\n## How to Use\n1. **Import the package**:\n   ```python\n   from csv_to_json_converter import convert_csv_to_json, set_delimiter, define_schema\n   ```\n\n2. **Set custom delimiter (if needed)**:\n   ```python\n   set_delimiter(\';\')  # for a semicolon-delimited CSV\n   ```\n\n3. **Define a schema (if needed)**:\n   ```python\n   schema = {"name": "str", "age": "int", "city": "str"}\n   define_schema(schema)\n   ```\n\n4. **Convert CSV to JSON**:\n   ```python\n   convert_csv_to_json(\'input.csv\', \'output.json\')\n   ```\n\n## Conclusion\nThis package provides a flexible way to convert CSV files to structured JSON. By allowing custom delimiters and schema definitions, users can easily tailor the output to their needs. Happy coding!', 'encoding': 'utf-8', 'mode': 'overwrite'}, 'stage': 'before'} 
